'''Whirlwind Sprint''' is a [[Skyrim:Shout|shout]] that causes you to rush forward at great speed. It can be used even if you are [[Skyrim:Carry Weight|overencumbered]].

This shout carries you horizontally, so do not use it to go down slopes; you will find yourself in mid-air when the sprint ends.

{{NewLeft}}
